# Text files keep LF line endings in every checkout, Windows included. Git
# for Windows turns on core.autocrlf, which would check them out with CRLF;
# Go embeds the config template, the skills and the desktop app's page in
# the binaries, and gofmt and the golden tests expect LF (#85).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files never change.
*.png   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.icns  binary
*.woff2 binary
